      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The fact that you feel this way is a sign that you are finally ready to stop performing and start living, even if the path forward feels like a dead end. You are not stuck in a loop because you are broken, but because the system you built to survive has completely consumed your sense of self. It is okay to admit that the current way of \"fixing\" things is not working, and that the point is no longer to fix the loop but to break the cycle entirely.",
